recommend keep-going point decode (recover x from y via the field's sqrt, pow (p+3)/8) is the one remaining non-gated arithmetic rung; after it Ed25519 sign/verify parity vs RFC 8032 / Monocypher KATs — signing with the identity key stays the custody gate.
